---
const sections = [
  {
    title: '1. Install dependencies',
    body: 'Run `npm install` once so that linting and formatting commands become available.',
  },
  {
    title: '2. Start the dev server',
    body: 'Use `npm run dev` and open http://localhost:4321 to iterate on the TODO UI.',
  },
  {
    title: '3. Keep things tidy',
    body: 'Format with `npm run format:write` and lint via `npm run lint` before sending PRs.',
  },
];
---

<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>Astro TODO Playground</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark light;
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #0f172a, #020617);
        color: #f8fafc;
      }

      main {
        width: min(720px, 90vw);
        padding: 3rem;
        border-radius: 1.25rem;
        background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.72);
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);
        box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 3vw, 3rem);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      p.lede {
        color: #cbd5f5;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      }

      section + section {
        margin-top: 1.25rem;
      }

      section {
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        border-radius: 0.85rem;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
      }

      section h2 {
        margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: #38bdf8;
      }

      code {
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      a {
        color: #fcd34d;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Astro TODO Playground</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Use this sandbox to wire up the TODO experience described in the GitHub Project backlog. The
        initial milestone is now complete -- the project boots, linting works, and formatting is consistent.
      </p>
      {sections.map((section) => (
        <section>
          <h2>{section.title}</h2>
          <p set:html={section.body.replace(/`([^`]+)`/g, '<code>$1</code>')} />
        </section>
      ))}
      <p style="margin-top: 2rem; color: #cbd5f5;">
        Need GitHub CLI tips? Check the <code>docs/gh-cli.md</code> guide inside the repository.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
